WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.158
Unit twelve. Being a Good Friend!

2
00:00:04.116 --> 00:00:07.766
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.816 --> 00:00:11.616
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.666 --> 00:00:15.433
Today we learn about Being a Good Friend. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.126 --> 00:00:19.526
Friend. Say it with me. Friend!

6
00:00:23.027 --> 00:00:26.194
Share. Say it with me. Share!

7
00:00:29.692 --> 00:00:33.042
Kind. Say it with me. Kind!

8
00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:39.917
Help. Say it with me. Help!

9
00:00:43.402 --> 00:00:46.852
Smile. Say it with me. Smile!

10
00:00:50.362 --> 00:00:53.762
Play. Say it with me. Play!

11
00:00:57.262 --> 00:01:00.762
Sorry. Say it with me. Sorry!

12
00:01:04.262 --> 00:01:07.696
Thank you. Say it with me. Thank you!

13
00:01:11.197 --> 00:01:19.380
A good friend is kind and likes to share. I help my friend when they fall and say sorry if I make a mistake. I smile and say thank you.

14
00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:20.650
I can do that too!

15
00:01:21.966 --> 00:01:27.158
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:27.208 --> 00:01:28.358
Kind!

17
00:01:29.188 --> 00:01:34.460
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:34.510 --> 00:01:35.660
Sorry!

19
00:01:36.622 --> 00:01:41.639
Did you know? Being kind can make both you and your friend feel happier!

20
00:01:41.689 --> 00:01:43.567
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:44.259 --> 00:01:51.729
Think and answer. How can you be a good friend today?

22
00:01:51.779 --> 00:01:52.929
Great answer!

23
00:01:54.015 --> 00:01:59.073
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:01:59.123 --> 00:02:01.791
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

